WEBVTT

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:08.690
It doesn't look like there's 
anything strange in this area.

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:11.150
Don't let your guard down.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:14.920
We're not only up against the O'bli anymore.

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:18.250
Humans with the same powers we have...

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.080
It's hard to believe.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.750
The combat log shows it.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:27.230
I'm worried about the weird 
girl Torte ran into, too.

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:30.460
Black Knight Odile, was it?

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:33.290
Sounds like a mysterious evildoer to me.

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:35.510
Who's a mysterious evildoer?!

00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:39.620
It's rude to mess up someone's name!

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:40.700
Where is she?

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:42.060
Over there.

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:44.490
And I'm not the Black Knight.

00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:45.900
I'm the Knight of the Black Swan!

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:48.970
I'm going to say my name again,

00:00:48.970 --> 00:00:51.450
so make sure you remember it.

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:56.860
I am the lone soldier who travels the 
rough path between time and space.

00:00:57.180 --> 00:01:00.160
I am the Knight of the Black Swan!

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:35.130
<b>Showdown! The Three Origami Sisters</b>

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:33.680
Odile...

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:35.130
...appeared?!

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:40.380
I thought you all had some 
mass dream or something.

00:02:40.380 --> 00:02:42.610
I didn't think she'd actually show up.

00:02:44.190 --> 00:02:46.670
You guys don't trust us at all.

00:02:46.670 --> 00:02:48.610
That's not surprising.

00:02:49.370 --> 00:02:50.940
So what happened?

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:53.770
She attacked us, telling us 
to give her our Memoca.

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:56.750
And she was really strong.

00:02:56.750 --> 00:02:59.240
Honestly, we were about to lose.

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:01.050
About to?

00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:05.050
Wh-What's up with her?

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:06.910
We're out of luck here.

00:03:07.270 --> 00:03:10.540
Realize how wonderfully powerful I am?

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:15.420
I am the Knight of the Black Swan, Odile.

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:18.670
The Knight of the Black Swan. 
Nice to meet you.

00:03:18.910 --> 00:03:20.580
Now give me your money—

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:23.760
I mean, give me all of your Memoca!

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:27.180
Come on, now!

00:03:28.630 --> 00:03:29.810
I hit my shin!

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:30.960
My shin! It hurts!

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:32.770
I'm going to die!

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:35.230
Damn it... You guys are good.

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:37.940
Don't think you've won!

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:44.500
That's the same thing that happened with us.

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:47.050
Yuumi, you guys have the next patrol, right?

00:03:47.050 --> 00:03:47.990
Be careful.

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:50.580
Yeah, thanks, Ryouko-chan.

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:53.060
It's not just Odile.

00:03:53.060 --> 00:03:56.280
The three that beat Pudding 
are out there, too.

00:03:58.520 --> 00:04:03.340
Anyway, we've proven that 
Odile really exists now.

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:07.560
But that doesn't really change 
the situation at hand.

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:10.080
Mana?

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:14.810
Let's do our best, Io-chin.

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:18.920
I know it's sudden,

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:22.100
but I'm going to have you do 
an emergency sortie instead.

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:23.400
Emergency sortie?

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:26.660
We've confirmed a dimensional 
distortion in Sector S, moshu.

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:28.530
An O'bli?

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:30.840
We haven't detected a signature yet,

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:33.290
but the probability of one 
being there is very high.

00:04:33.820 --> 00:04:35.430
Um, Sensei...

00:04:35.430 --> 00:04:36.240
Yes?

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:38.880
Did you figure out anything 
about Akara-chin and the others?

00:04:39.510 --> 00:04:42.280
We're analyzing the data, but...

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:43.330
All we've found is

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:48.430
that they didn't appear with an accompanying 
dimensional distortion like the O'bli, moshu.

00:04:48.630 --> 00:04:50.340
What's that about?

00:04:50.340 --> 00:04:56.060
They're traveling to the dimensional border 
from this world, just like Fifth Force.

00:04:56.310 --> 00:05:00.070
Then Akara-chin and the others 
are in this world somewhere!

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:02.720
So I can see them again someday!

00:05:04.760 --> 00:05:06.450
I'm so hungry.

00:05:06.770 --> 00:05:11.910
Yeah, we didn't get hungry at all 
when we were back there.

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:14.720
It's cruel to make us go without food.

00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:16.170
Are you okay, Koori?

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:17.750
Yes.

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:22.760
We need to...

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:25.550
...defeat Altair Torte at any cost.

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:30.550
Nothing seems out of the ordinary right now.

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:33.120
The three Origami sisters...

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:36.160
Maybe we'll run into them 
walking through town.

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:38.810
Oh, but we don't know what Odile looks like.

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:42.220
Our world is pretty big, too.

00:05:42.220 --> 00:05:45.110
It's hard to imagine we'd 
just run into each other.

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:48.890
It feels completely different 
just knowing that we might.

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:52.400
What are you going to do 
if you run into those three?

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:55.850
Well, Mana's...

00:06:03.320 --> 00:06:04.210
An O'bli!

00:06:05.440 --> 00:06:06.670
This is Altair Torte.

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:08.160
<i>We have an O'bli.</i>

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:09.460
<i>Sending data.</i>

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:13.330
It's a mid-sized Magire O'bli.

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:14.850
A new type.

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:16.350
It looks like a lizard.

00:06:24.180 --> 00:06:25.240
It melted.

00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:27.240
We have to be careful getting close to it.

00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:30.290
Satoka and Mana-chan, 
pin it down from the sides.

00:06:30.290 --> 00:06:30.820
Right.

00:06:31.140 --> 00:06:34.250
Yuumi, focus your fire on the O'bli's face.

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:38.540
Io and I will attack from behind 
when we get the chance.

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:39.290
Roger.

00:06:42.230 --> 00:06:43.380
Here I go!

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:02.410
You won't get away!

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:07.990
Focused bombardment!

00:07:18.630 --> 00:07:19.500
We did it!

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:22.620
That was surprisingly easy.

00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:23.380
Huh?

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:25.650
Yuumi!

00:07:25.650 --> 00:07:26.670
Yuumi-chin!

00:07:27.870 --> 00:07:29.560
Only the tail's still alive.

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:31.430
You don't have to copy 
a real lizard that much!

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:34.260
We have to be careful attacking now.

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:37.410
More O'bli?

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:43.400
What?!

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:47.150
You're Altair Torte?

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:50.020
What if we are?

00:07:50.020 --> 00:07:51.680
I knew it!

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:53.370
It's Origami Akara-chin!

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:53.860
Huh?

00:07:53.860 --> 00:07:55.130
It's you, right?

00:07:55.130 --> 00:07:57.120
And Hina-chin and Koori-chin, too.

00:07:57.650 --> 00:07:59.000
Who are you?

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:01.290
Why do you know our names?

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:03.260
I'm Mana.

00:08:03.260 --> 00:08:04.420
Don't you remember?

00:08:04.720 --> 00:08:05.540
Mana?

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:08.040
You're Namori Mana?

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:09.760
That crybaby, Mana-chan?

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:11.300
Yeah, that's right!

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:12.090
It's me!

00:08:12.350 --> 00:08:13.680
It's Mana!

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:16.880
Koori, you were little, 
so I don't think you remember,

00:08:16.880 --> 00:08:19.570
but a long time ago, we were 
together in the orphanage.

00:08:19.570 --> 00:08:20.560
Orphanage?

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:23.980
Who would have thought that 
Mana-chan would be in Fifth Force?

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:25.740
Why?

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:28.860
Why are you guys fighting us?

00:08:29.220 --> 00:08:30.400
Who cares?

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:33.280
We were ordered to take 
you out, and that's all.

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:35.100
Ordered to?

00:08:35.100 --> 00:08:35.910
By who?

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:37.320
By Morgana-sama.

00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:40.620
Morgana...

00:08:44.130 --> 00:08:44.830
Tsubame?

00:08:45.990 --> 00:08:49.170
Morgana... Is that the name of your boss?

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:51.190
Just get ready.

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:54.500
Sorry, but we need to eat.

00:08:57.020 --> 00:08:57.840
Don't move!

00:08:57.840 --> 00:08:58.760
Huh?

00:08:58.760 --> 00:08:59.390
Why?

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:02.520
It was difficult to just burn off the tail.

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:04.390
And it was a bit scary, too.

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:07.100
You think you've won?

00:09:14.020 --> 00:09:15.570
Don't!

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:17.950
You can't, Akara-chin!

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:19.890
What's the idea?

00:09:19.890 --> 00:09:23.980
You guys and I are all 
from the same world.

00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:25.920
It doesn't make sense to fight!

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:27.580
The same world?

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:31.910
I know that you lived together 
with Mana in the same orphanage.

00:09:31.910 --> 00:09:32.920
So why are you...

00:09:33.160 --> 00:09:34.060
Hmph.

00:09:34.060 --> 00:09:35.760
You don't understand anything.

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:37.510
That's as far as you go.

00:09:43.090 --> 00:09:44.070
Everyone...

00:09:44.070 --> 00:09:44.890
Why are you...

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:48.440
The Time-Space Administrator 
assembled us all.

00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:51.320
In order to capture them.

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:55.360
We'll have to come back another time.

00:09:57.220 --> 00:09:58.990
This is bad! Scatter!

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:07.080
They're gone.

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:09.240
Looks like they got away.

00:10:09.240 --> 00:10:12.350
I wanted to get them back for 
humiliating us the other day.

00:10:23.440 --> 00:10:28.440
It's true that a missing persons report was 
filed ten years ago from that orphanage.

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:32.060
<i>However, there was no 
trace of them after that.</i>

00:10:32.380 --> 00:10:35.980
It's unthinkable that three small children 
were able to survive on their own.

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:39.410
So we believe that the three sisters

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:42.790
<i>completely vanished from this world, moshu.</i>

00:10:42.790 --> 00:10:46.490
So that "Morgana" that the three 
sisters were talking about...

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:47.910
Tsubame?

00:10:49.850 --> 00:10:51.230
Morgana...

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:52.880
I remember that from somewhere...

00:10:53.100 --> 00:10:55.880
It's very likely that the three Origami sisters 
were taken to another dimension,

00:10:56.200 --> 00:11:00.540
<i>or the dimensional divide, 
by an unknown party.</i>

00:11:00.540 --> 00:11:03.720
Kidnapped to another dimension, huh?

00:11:04.030 --> 00:11:06.600
And then they were trained as soldiers...

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:08.850
That... That can't be true!

00:11:09.160 --> 00:11:12.520
If they were abducted, 
then we need to secure them.

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:15.610
Everyone, we have to save them somehow!

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:17.650
Yeah, but...

00:11:17.650 --> 00:11:18.880
Even if we want to save them,

00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:21.360
they're going to keep attacking us...

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:22.610
But...

00:11:24.340 --> 00:11:25.490
But...

00:11:28.690 --> 00:11:30.720
I guess we have to go without food again.

00:11:30.720 --> 00:11:34.070
Morgana really doesn't care 
about that sort of thing...

00:11:34.070 --> 00:11:35.210
I'm hungry.

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:37.340
Bear it just a little longer.

00:11:37.740 --> 00:11:39.090
All right!

00:11:39.330 --> 00:11:41.180
I'll do something about this.

00:11:45.310 --> 00:11:48.130
I'm getting kind of dizzy.

00:11:51.780 --> 00:11:55.940
I'm not going to just find food that easily, huh?

00:11:56.530 --> 00:11:57.440
Roger.

00:11:57.800 --> 00:11:59.860
They all said they can't find them.

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:01.240
They got away.

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:07.450
You'll be able to see them again.

00:12:07.860 --> 00:12:10.580
Akara-chin and the others will
understand eventually, right?

00:12:11.020 --> 00:12:12.140
Yeah.

00:12:12.140 --> 00:12:14.840
Isn't there some way to talk to them?

00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:16.120
Hmm...

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:22.800
Someone's collapsed over there.

00:12:26.240 --> 00:12:28.340
I ate so much.

00:12:28.340 --> 00:12:29.140
Thanks.

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:31.230
That was really good.

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:33.250
It was, wasn't it?

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:36.480
It was Cuisenaire Sajima-san's 
special pork cutlet bowl.

00:12:36.890 --> 00:12:39.540
To think she was just hungry.

00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:42.380
We brought her here, but now what?

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:44.700
We need to get information 
out of her somehow.

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:46.440
Yeah.

00:12:46.440 --> 00:12:48.660
Information on Morgana, too.

00:12:49.070 --> 00:12:50.700
We've got more.

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:51.970
Thank you.

00:12:51.970 --> 00:12:52.950
I'm good now.

00:12:53.220 --> 00:12:56.290
This is the first time I've had 
a pork cutlet bowl this good.

00:12:57.030 --> 00:12:59.130
So this is your base?

00:12:59.350 --> 00:13:00.780
Is it called Eterno?

00:13:00.780 --> 00:13:02.440
You're planning on running?

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:04.070
You're already too late.

00:13:05.500 --> 00:13:07.930
I contacted Onee and Koori.

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:09.010
What?

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:11.430
That looks like our patori.

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:20.350
Akara-chin, Koori-chin!

00:13:20.350 --> 00:13:21.900
How did you get into Eterno?

00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:25.000
It's easy once we know where it is.

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:27.570
If we borrow Morgana-sama's abilities, that is.

00:13:27.830 --> 00:13:29.450
Who's Morgana?

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:32.620
Morgana-sama controls all.

00:13:33.060 --> 00:13:34.840
Akara-chin, stop it!

00:13:34.840 --> 00:13:37.210
Think of when we played at the orphanage!

00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:40.420
I don't want to remember that place.

00:13:41.540 --> 00:13:47.680
Do you know just how hard I worked 
to run away with my little sisters?

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:52.280
If Morgana-sama hadn't helped us,

00:13:56.300 --> 00:13:59.800
who knows how we would have ended up?

00:14:03.560 --> 00:14:07.820
We swore our allegiance 
to Morgana-sama after that.

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:13.380
Morgana-sama's orders 
mean everything to us.

00:14:13.380 --> 00:14:17.580
And those orders are to 
take out Altair Torte.

00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:19.560
I know.

00:14:19.560 --> 00:14:22.100
I'll fight you, Akara-chin.

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:22.580
What?

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:23.600
Mana-chan?

00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:26.550
But in exchange, if we win,

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:28.050
I want you to stop doing bad things.

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:30.910
Huh? What are you saying?

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:32.770
We're not going to lose.

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:34.560
Interesting.

00:14:35.210 --> 00:14:37.820
In that case, we have a condition, too.

00:14:39.990 --> 00:14:43.710
Could you let Koori and me eat, too?

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:51.510
Those two sure ate a lot.

00:14:51.510 --> 00:14:53.660
They're very mysterious,

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:56.120
but everyone has hunger pangs the same.

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:56.910
Seconds.

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:59.290
I just had to say all that...

00:14:59.680 --> 00:15:01.470
If their target were us,

00:15:01.470 --> 00:15:03.960
we'd have to settle this sooner or later.

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:08.740
I don't think those sisters 
are bad people at heart.

00:15:08.740 --> 00:15:13.640
Yeah, no one who eats so joyfully can be bad.

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:16.020
Thanks, everyone.

00:15:16.020 --> 00:15:19.280
But we couldn't do anything 
against Amane-chin alone...

00:15:19.280 --> 00:15:20.720
Can we really win?

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:24.210
Don't think about "can."

00:15:24.210 --> 00:15:25.650
We will win.

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:28.740
Mana, you want to get close 
to those three again, right?

00:15:30.140 --> 00:15:31.120
Yeah.

00:15:32.810 --> 00:15:34.780
A duel, huh?

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:37.540
Yes. Please allow it.

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:40.040
Please, Tierra-sensei!

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:41.380
Please.

00:15:41.380 --> 00:15:42.040
Sensei!

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:45.880
I can't allow you to deploy 
for personal reasons like that.

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:47.340
Sensei!

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:48.630
However...

00:15:49.100 --> 00:15:50.590
You promised, right?

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:54.130
You can't break your promises.

00:15:55.540 --> 00:15:58.300
I will allow it as a special 
circumstance this time,

00:15:58.300 --> 00:16:01.060
but please don't push yourselves too hard.

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:02.810
Right!

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:11.160
This is the right atmosphere for a duel.

00:16:11.160 --> 00:16:12.000
Yeah.

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:13.020
They're here.

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:17.280
You have my praise for 
coming and not fleeing.

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:21.910
I thank you for saving us the trouble.

00:16:24.860 --> 00:16:26.500
Everyone, let's go.

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:28.670
Here I go.

00:16:30.430 --> 00:16:31.260
They're fast!

00:16:34.290 --> 00:16:34.970
Too slow!

00:16:43.190 --> 00:16:44.400
Tsubame-chan!

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:46.730
<i>You don't have time to worry 
about someone else!</i>

00:16:50.020 --> 00:16:52.320
Was it really okay to give them 
permission to do this, moshu?

00:16:52.640 --> 00:16:56.320
There was no other way to know what 
the three Origami sisters are after.

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:59.920
Also, I want to help them, if possible.

00:16:59.920 --> 00:17:01.700
Those three sisters, moshu?

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:04.540
I'm sure those kids...

00:17:05.070 --> 00:17:08.250
would have been happier 
being raised in this world.

00:17:11.490 --> 00:17:13.000
Are you still going to fight?

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:15.050
You know the difference 
in our strength, right?

00:17:15.560 --> 00:17:17.010
We know.

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:19.260
But we still haven't lost.

00:17:19.560 --> 00:17:20.760
Actually...

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:23.390
We can't lose this fight.

00:17:23.920 --> 00:17:24.980
Everyone...

00:17:26.660 --> 00:17:27.730
Why?

00:17:28.220 --> 00:17:29.980
You know you can't win.

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:32.900
Because you promised that if we win,

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:36.450
you guys wouldn't do anything bad anymore.

00:17:37.150 --> 00:17:40.780
I'm not doing this because I want to.

00:17:41.530 --> 00:17:45.280
But in order for the 
three of us to survive...

00:17:45.900 --> 00:17:48.920
In order to protect my sisters...

00:17:49.280 --> 00:17:53.870
We'll do anything for 
Morgana-sama. She saved us.

00:17:53.870 --> 00:17:56.170
Anything more is a waste of time.

00:17:56.500 --> 00:17:57.260
Let's finish them.

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:59.640
Yeah. Onee.

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:00.320
Right.

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:02.060
Let's go, you two.

00:18:02.630 --> 00:18:04.020
Akara-chin...

00:18:05.200 --> 00:18:06.520
Prepare yourselves!

00:18:06.920 --> 00:18:08.820
I don't want this...

00:18:09.360 --> 00:18:11.560
I don't want this at all!

00:18:11.910 --> 00:18:13.070
Mana-chan...

00:18:15.520 --> 00:18:16.780
No...

00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:19.920
I don't want to let that happen again!

00:18:23.310 --> 00:18:24.390
What's going on?

00:18:25.060 --> 00:18:26.450
I can't believe it, moshu.

00:18:26.780 --> 00:18:30.670
A different dimension is breaking 
into the dimensional boundary, moshu!

00:18:30.940 --> 00:18:32.050
What's going on?

00:18:32.050 --> 00:18:32.880
The sky is...

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:34.160
...the Earth?!

00:18:34.160 --> 00:18:35.090
What's going on?

00:18:42.320 --> 00:18:45.090
The boundary has returned to normal, moshu.

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:49.600
Another dimension was 
breaking in... That can't...

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:51.940
Tsubame!

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:54.700
Onee, what was that?

00:18:54.700 --> 00:18:56.290
I don't know...

00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:58.420
I've finally found you.

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:05.240
Morgana-sama?

00:19:05.720 --> 00:19:06.850
Morgana?

00:19:06.850 --> 00:19:08.040
That's...

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:11.580
Mor...gana?

00:19:12.280 --> 00:19:15.340
So you did flee to this dimension.

00:19:17.720 --> 00:19:24.280
I knew you'd appear sometime if 
I used these girls to release O'bli.

00:19:24.280 --> 00:19:27.440
Morgana-sama, what are you talking about?

00:19:27.880 --> 00:19:34.060
Oh, Akara-san, Hina-san, 
Koori-san, good work.

00:19:34.800 --> 00:19:36.900
I've no further use for you.

00:19:37.470 --> 00:19:39.190
What does that mean?!

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:41.700
I don't need you anymore.

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:43.150
What?!

00:19:43.150 --> 00:19:46.490
Morgana-sama, you were just 
using us to find something?!

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:50.090
It's best to use something of a given world

00:19:50.090 --> 00:19:53.210
to find something that escaped 
to said world, right?

00:19:53.780 --> 00:19:56.210
So we spent ten years for that...

00:19:56.580 --> 00:20:02.430
Ten years for a human is but
a blink of an eye for me.

00:20:02.670 --> 00:20:05.350
Then what are we supposed to do now?

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:12.230
I don't really care what happens to you.

00:20:13.140 --> 00:20:14.760
Screw you!

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:17.440
It's no use.

00:20:19.090 --> 00:20:22.610
I can predict all phenomena.

00:20:22.870 --> 00:20:24.480
That's enough!

00:20:30.150 --> 00:20:31.080
Odile!

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:32.620
What is this?

00:20:33.300 --> 00:20:36.880
I saw a super strong Stella Prism 
signature and came to see.

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:38.210
It was you, wasn't it?!

00:20:38.470 --> 00:20:39.440
Who's that?

00:20:39.440 --> 00:20:40.300
I don't know.

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:42.880
Give me your Stella Prism!

00:20:45.860 --> 00:20:47.510
Just who are you?

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:52.140
I am here!

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:53.160
I'll skip the middle.

00:20:53.160 --> 00:20:55.940
Knight of the Black Swan, Odile-sama!

00:20:56.380 --> 00:21:00.160
To think there would be 
events I couldn't predict...

00:21:01.720 --> 00:21:02.960
Very well.

00:21:03.600 --> 00:21:05.070
I shall withdraw.

00:21:08.570 --> 00:21:10.050
Hey, wait!

00:21:10.050 --> 00:21:11.490
I'm not letting you get away!

00:21:11.490 --> 00:21:15.220
Give me your Prism!

00:21:16.360 --> 00:21:17.880
Morgana-sama...

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:21.050
She doesn't need us anymore?

00:21:21.360 --> 00:21:24.170
What should we do now?

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:27.980
It's okay.

00:21:28.890 --> 00:21:32.060
Come to Eterno with all of us.

00:21:32.060 --> 00:21:34.930
I'm sure the others will be 
your friends right away...

00:21:34.930 --> 00:21:36.020
No.

00:21:36.430 --> 00:21:37.860
We can't do that.

00:21:37.860 --> 00:21:40.340
Let's go, Hina, Koori.

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:53.430
It might not happen right away, but...

00:21:54.950 --> 00:21:55.830
Yeah.

00:21:56.310 --> 00:22:00.080
I will become their friend.

00:22:00.480 --> 00:22:01.180
Yeah.

00:23:36.010 --> 00:23:41.020
<b>Youth! The Crimson Duel</b>

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:41.020
"Youth! The Crimson Duel."
